message: "If you use anythingtoexplainer in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "anythingtoexplainer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wei
    given-names: Yihao
    alias: Vincentwei1021
repository-code: "https://github.com/lankyjo/anythingtoexplainer"
url: "https://github.com/lankyjo/anythingtoexplainer"
abstract: >-
  An agent skill that turns any topic into a narrated motion-graphics explainer
  video, English only. Three selectable visual packs (paper, instrument,
  poster) on a warm light canvas; every frame is drawn in code with Remotion
  (React + TypeScript), with local kokoro-82m voiceover, subtitles and a
  chapter progress bar. Ships a compilable template, pack chrome and
  primitives, voiceover / storyboard / render / QC tooling, written style and
  motion specs, agent build and QC protocols, and three sample films.
keywords:
  - agent-skill
  - explainer-video
  - motion-graphics
  - remotion
  - text-to-speech
